            <ArticleTitle>[From social distress to psychic pain].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>525-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Regarding 75 subjects of both sex sent to psychiatric and alcological consultations by social departments to which they required some help, the authors ask the question about limits between social alienation and mental alienation for people in precarity and poverty position. They inquire into role part and position of the psychiatrist beside them.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
